  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **That Home Far Away**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **The Albino Skunk**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **No More Paper Logs**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Dealing Despair [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **strings-julin2015-08-15** (recommended): source not stated; 12 songs; 57 min; rated 4.5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer says Billy was 23 at the time and planned to see him in Phoenix in November [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **strings-julin2015-08-15**: Billy Strings and Don Julin with Kevin Gills; recorded with Line Audio CM3 microphones into a Tascam DR-2d at 24-bit/48kHz; Edited in Audacity (fades, levels, downconverted to 16/44), then processed through CD Wave and encoded to FLAC [1]",
